{"id":"u122","kelas":"travel","no":1,"judul":"Di Bandara dan Imigrasi","title":"At the Airport and Immigration","emoji":"🛂","ringkas":"Check-in, boarding pass, paspor, bea cukai, dan menjawab petugas","ready":true,"goals":["memakai **kata dan frasa bandara**: check-in, boarding pass, gate, customs","menjawab **pertanyaan petugas imigrasi** dengan jelas","memahami **pengumuman** di bandara","meminta bantuan saat bagasi atau penerbangan bermasalah"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Perjalanan ke luar negeri dimulai di bandara. Pelajari kata dan frasa penting, lalu latih menjawab petugas imigrasi dengan kalimat pendek dan jelas."},{"t":"vocab","title":"1. Di bandara","items":[{"en":"check-in","id":"lapor masuk / daftar penerbangan","ex":"Check-in opens three hours before the flight."},{"en":"boarding pass","id":"kartu naik pesawat","ex":"Please show your boarding pass."},{"en":"gate","id":"pintu keberangkatan","ex":"Your flight leaves from gate twelve."},{"en":"departure","id":"keberangkatan","ex":"The departure time is ten thirty."},{"en":"arrival","id":"kedatangan","ex":"The arrival hall is downstairs."},{"en":"baggage claim","id":"pengambilan bagasi","ex":"The bags are at baggage claim."},{"en":"carry-on","id":"bagasi kabin","ex":"I have one carry-on bag."},{"en":"delayed","id":"tertunda","ex":"The flight is delayed by one hour."}]},{"t":"vocab","title":"2. Imigrasi dan bea cukai","items":[{"en":"passport","id":"paspor","ex":"Please show your passport."},{"en":"visa","id":"visa","ex":"Do I need a visa?"},{"en":"immigration","id":"imigrasi","ex":"Immigration is on the left."},{"en":"customs","id":"bea cukai","ex":"Go through customs with your bags."},{"en":"declare","id":"mendeklarasikan barang","ex":"Do you have anything to declare?"},{"en":"purpose of your visit","id":"tujuan kunjunganmu","ex":"What is the purpose of your visit?"},{"en":"tourist","id":"turis / wisatawan","ex":"I am a tourist."},{"en":"return ticket","id":"tiket pulang","ex":"Do you have a return tick